  "discussion": "## Control\n\nRoute remote accesses through authorized and managed network access control points.\n\n## Discussion\n\nOrganizations consider the Trusted Internet Connections (TIC) initiative [DHS TIC](https://www.dhs.gov/trusted-internet-connections) requirements for external network connections since limiting the number of access control points for remote access reduces attack surfaces.",
